    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d407">

                <pb facs="0629" n="582" xml:id="pg582"/>

                <head>407. Telegram 1372 to Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d407-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-12-10">December 10, 1955, 12:51
                            p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d407-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d407-1"/>
                <p>1372. For David Osborn.</p>
                <p>Examine carefully entire record of talks and telegraph Department earliest
                    whether Chinese Communists ever told explicitly US would not negotiate subjects
                    involving rights and interests GRC without their presence.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Dulles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
